          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "逻辑执行顺序是 FROM → WHERE → GROUP BY → HAVING → SELECT → ORDER BY → LIMIT。JOIN 属于 FROM 阶段，先形成中间结果，再由 WHERE 过滤行、GROUP BY 聚合、HAVING 过滤组。"
